## 8. Decision

| Venue | Score (1 to 5) | Acceptance probability | Confidence | Change that moves it most |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| WEIS 2027 | 2 (upper end) | 25% | Medium | The honest-churn arm, with the paper cut to 12 pages around it |
